{"3485020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The King's Legend", "steam_appid": 3485020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The King's Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gritty, medieval fantasy turn-based strategy game where every move is a matter of sacrifice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit at the war table as a king locked in a deadly duel against a rival monarch. Across a hex-based battlefield, command an evolving army of Soldiers, Knights, Wizards, and powerful Legends. With each turn, you must make brutal decisions—sacrifice your own to strengthen the rest, upgrade your forces, and regenerate lost pieces to outwit your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Played for millennia, this ancient game is more than tradition—your kingdom’s fate hangs in the balance. Challenge your friends in intense 1v1 battles where cleverness trumps brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think carefully, strike boldly—only the smartest king will rise to legend.<br><br><i>A Duel Demands Two. </i></strong><i>The King's Legend is a head-to-head experience—built for rivalry, not solitude. Whether side by side or connected through Steam Remote Play, a challenger is required. No friend at the ready? Seek one out. A true duel waits for no one.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The King's Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gritty, medieval fantasy turn-based strategy game where every move is a matter of sacrifice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit at the war table as a king locked in a deadly duel against a rival monarch. Across a hex-based battlefield, command an evolving army of Soldiers, Knights, Wizards, and powerful Legends. With each turn, you must make brutal decisions—sacrifice your own to strengthen the rest, upgrade your forces, and regenerate lost pieces to outwit your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Played for millennia, this ancient game is more than tradition—your kingdom’s fate hangs in the balance. Challenge your friends in intense 1v1 battles where cleverness trumps brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think carefully, strike boldly—only the smartest king will rise to legend.<br><br><i>A Duel Demands Two. </i></strong><i>The King's Legend is a head-to-head experience—built for rivalry, not solitude. Whether side by side or connected through Steam Remote Play, a challenger is required. No friend at the ready? Seek one out. A true duel waits for no one.</i></p>", "short_description": "Fight your way to victory by strategically sacrificing, upgrading, and regenerating your pieces. Duel your friends in this fantasy turn-based strategy game, seizing every advantage you can. Let the wiser king become the legend!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485020/3fcb4829bc64bd4eb49633371d8e95df977dfeef/header.jpg?t=1763005400", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485020/d14b5c429ee483417584a67e05371ee88cebc42f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763005400", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485020/d14b5c429ee483417584a67e05371ee88cebc42f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763005400", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"